# Папки
/.vs
/.claude
/3rd_party/_LIB
/3rd_party/_TEMP
/ogsr_engine/_LIB
/ogsr_engine/_TEMP
/bin*

# 3rd-party upstream payloads — NOT vendored, same policy as every other dependency
# (most of them nest the clone in a subdir and ignore it via their own
# 3rd_party/Src/<dep>/.gitignore, e.g. NVIDIA_DLSS/.gitignore). These two unpack
# straight into their dep folder instead of a nested one, so the rule lives here —
# and meshoptimizer ships its OWN .gitignore, which must not be clobbered.
#   NVIDIA_Streamline — ~67 MB prebuilt binary drop (bin/include/lib), SL 2.12.0
#   meshoptimizer     — upstream repo root (src/, tools/…), v1.2
# Both are consumed by 3rd_party/Src/vulkan_renderer.props + xrRender_Vulkan.vcxproj
# (vk_sl.cpp / vk_dlss.cpp / vk_meshopt.cpp). See Update_Components.cmd to refetch.
/3rd_party/Src/NVIDIA_Streamline/
/3rd_party/Src/meshoptimizer/

# Same treatment, same reason — they unpack flat rather than into a nested clone
# dir. Unlike everything above, these two are BUILT here, so the folder also
# holds a CMake tree: ~216 MB, nearly all of it build output.
#   RmlUi    — HTML/CSS UI layer, tag 6.2       (xrGame/ui_rml.cpp)
#   freetype — glyph rasteriser, VER-2-13-3, which RmlUi's font engine needs
# xrGame.vcxproj hardwires both the headers and the built libs:
#   ...\Src\RmlUi\Include  ...\Src\RmlUi\build\Release\rmlui.lib
#   ...\Src\freetype\build\Release\freetype.lib
# so those paths are part of the contract. See Update_Components.cmd to refetch
# and rebuild.
/3rd_party/Src/RmlUi/
/3rd_party/Src/freetype/

# Build intermediaries (MSBuild ObjectFileName="obj\")
**/obj/

# Stray nested MSBuild output (xrCore built into a nested _TEMP tree)
**/_TEMP/

# Codex agent scaffolding (not engine code)
/.codex/
# AGENTS.md only points at /.codex/memory/, which is ignored above — committing it
# would publish a dangling reference to a directory that is not in the repository.
/AGENTS.md

# Personal working notes / roadmaps — thinking-in-progress, not engine source.
/aiUp.md
/gpu_npc_ai_roadmap.md
/gpu_npc_render_milestone1.md
/gpu_particles_roadmap.md

# Local build helpers (machine-specific paths; the canonical build is Engine.sln).
# Every one of these hardcodes an absolute checkout path and a specific VS /
# Vulkan-SDK install, so they are useless to anyone else and go stale the moment
# the repo is cloned elsewhere. Keep your own copies locally.
/_build_*.bat
/_parked/

# Build output captured to a file — regenerated on every build, never reviewable
# in a diff. Applies to the whole tree (msbuild logs, glslc logs, shader
# compile errors under Layers/xrRenderVulkan/).
*.log
build_err.txt
/_build_*.txt


# Content-extraction toolchain for the Anomaly/GAMMA archives. Kept out of the
# engine repo deliberately: it is an authoring-side utility, not something the
# engine builds or links, and it exists to read third-party mod distributions.
/tools/

# Precompiled Headers
*.ipch

# Всякий ненужный мусор:
*.VC.*
*.suo
*.user
*.exp
*.aps
*.TMP

# Windows image file caches
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Folder config file
Desktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

/gamedata
/gamedata*
/_appdata_
/fsgame*
/mods

/CppDependOut
/OGSR_Engine_private.cdproj

ogsr_build_info.hpp
# Vendored third-party build tree: kept locally, never committed here.
/3rd_party/GameNetworkingSockets/

# AMD FidelityFX SDK — fetched manually, see Update_Components.cmd
/3rd_party/Src/AMD_FidelityFX/
